[REQUIREMENT]
UID: AC-SRS003
TITLE: Render requests as facility, call sign, position, request
STATEMENT: >>>
A request shall be rendered as the facility, the full call sign, the position when the call is an initial contact or a position report, and then the request, separated by commas and ended with a period. An ATIS request shall omit the position. A pattern-entry request that already has the information letter shall include with information and the phonetic letter. Acceptance is the ATIS request for Example Tower and N123AB, and the pattern-entry request from the ramp with information alpha, both parsing back to the same kind and registration.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
One renderer is the source of the request order.
<<<
DAL: E
